.TH std::experimental::max 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::experimental::max \- std::experimental::max

.SH Synopsis
Defined in header <experimental/simd>
template< class T, class Abi >
simd<T, Abi> max( const simd<T, Abi>& a, const simd<T, Abi>& b )       (parallelism TS v2)
noexcept;

.SH Parameters

a - the first vector of elements for max
b - the second vector of elements for max

.SH Return value

The result of binary element-wise application of std::max(a[i], b[i]) for all i ∈ [0,
size()).

